{"id": "ho_can_fill_exact_with_packages", "signature": "solve(package_sizes, target)", "statement": "`package_sizes` is a list of positive integers, each of which may be used any number of times (including zero times). `target` is a non-negative integer. Return True if some combination of packages (with repetition allowed) has a total size exactly equal to `target`, otherwise False. An empty list of packages can only fill a target of 0, which returns True.", "tests": [{"args": [[3, 5], 8], "expected": true}, {"args": [[3, 5], 7], "expected": false}, {"args": [[4, 6], 0], "expected": true}, {"args": [[], 0], "expected": true}, {"args": [[], 3], "expected": false}, {"args": [[2], 7], "expected": false}, {"args": [[7], 7], "expected": true}, {"args": [[6, 10, 15], 29], "expected": false}, {"args": [[6, 10, 15], 30], "expected": true}, {"args": [[1], 1000], "expected": true}, {"args": [[10, 15], 12], "expected": false}, {"args": [[3], 1000], "expected": false}, {"args": [[2, 4], 0], "expected": true}], "facts": [["arg", "package_sizes", "int_list"], ["arg", "target", "int"], ["items", "package_sizes"], ["target", "target"], ["ask", "feasible"], ["size", "package_sizes", "tiny"], ["size", "target", "small"], ["guarantees", "package_sizes", "positive"]], "deps": {"schema": ["knapsack"], "uses": ["knap_feasible"], "solution_sha256": "792c1bb197d0501b8f1c16052e736badfdecf700eb9bf0a3b75b74bbc53c2c2c", "reference_sha256": "2d604f93945973893c25269631d5460213345bed6c4b3d8452ec980d6538ed4a"}}